    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n60087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κροκό-εις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εσσα</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>saffron coloured</i>, prob.l. in <i><span class="en">
